{"4619940":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Guardian of Boss Neko","steam_appid":4619940,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4911870],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian of Boss Neko is a 2D anime-style top-down survivor-like game that incorporates a gathering mechanic. You play as a maiden Guardian, guiding Boss Neko to gather Magic Crystals while beating up monsters (or getting beaten up by them).<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Gathering and Protection】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Boss Neko to find and gather Magic Crystal mines while surrounded by monsters. Use the Magic Crystals you gather at Boss Neko's Shop to strengthen your team and hold off wave after wave of monster attacks.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Multiple Guardian Characters】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different maiden Guardians to join Boss Neko's adventure. Use their distinctive weapons and Specialties to experience different combat styles and build tendencies.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【A Rich Array of Build Items】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Attack Items, 120+ support items, and 20+ bond items, enabling a variety of builds with plenty of gameplay freedom.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Team Buffs】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides 20+ in-run team buffs to offer players tendency-oriented, distinctive playstyles.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Meta Progression】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports permanent out-of-run buff growth that gradually raises your base strength, helping you overcome the difficulty threshold of hard maps and rewarding long-term play.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian of Boss Neko is a 2D anime-style top-down survivor-like game that incorporates a gathering mechanic. You play as a maiden Guardian, guiding Boss Neko to gather Magic Crystals while beating up monsters (or getting beaten up by them).<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Gathering and Protection】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Boss Neko to find and gather Magic Crystal mines while surrounded by monsters. Use the Magic Crystals you gather at Boss Neko's Shop to strengthen your team and hold off wave after wave of monster attacks.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Multiple Guardian Characters】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different maiden Guardians to join Boss Neko's adventure. Use their distinctive weapons and Specialties to experience different combat styles and build tendencies.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【A Rich Array of Build Items】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Attack Items, 120+ support items, and 20+ bond items, enabling a variety of builds with plenty of gameplay freedom.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Team Buffs】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provides 20+ in-run team buffs to offer players tendency-oriented, distinctive playstyles.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Meta Progression】<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports permanent out-of-run buff growth that gradually raises your base strength, helping you overcome the difficulty threshold of hard maps and rewarding long-term play.<\/p>","short_description":"Guardian of Boss Neko is a 2D anime-style top-down survivor-like game that incorporates a gathering mechanic. You play as a maiden Guardian, guiding Boss Neko to gather Magic Crystals while beating up monsters (or getting beaten up by them).","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/s